          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.12.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 12.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Atayiolo sii ajo eitu eishori Ilawi irubat enye; metaa ore Ilawi o laranyak apa oasisho, neisika ake pooki ng'ae alo enkurma enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku aisikong'a nanu lelo kituaak najoki, “Kainyoo pee etung'uayioki enkaji e Nkai?” Naiturrur nanu ninche tenebo napik iwuejitin enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAL.3.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 3.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neya Yuda imatuan e tomon e ntapa, o enaisho oo sabibu, o eilata aaya nena ajijik naashumishoreki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nagelu nanu metaa ilashumak ooitasheiki nena ajijik naashumishoreki, Shelemia ilo apolosani, o Sadok olaigeroni, o Pedaia loo Lawi, ore olaretoni lenye naa Hanan olayioni le Sakur, olayioni le Matamia, amu ninche apa eisiligaki. Ore apa esiaai enye naa pee eoriki ilalashera lenye ntokitin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tadamuaki nanu, Enkai, ai, tialo ena, nimijut iyie aiwuang'ie nena kiasin aainei sidain nataasa nanu te nkaraki enkaji e Nkai ai o te nkaraki enkisiaayiare enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
