              "NEH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.8+EXO.20.9+EXO.20.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 20.8-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.12+DEU.5.13+DEU.5.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 5.12-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.17.21+JER.17.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 17.21-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore apa te nena olong'i, atoduaa nanu lelo tung'ana te Yuda eironyu enaisho oo sabibu too nkironyata te nkolong e sabato, neyau isotot le ntapa neirotoki ninche isirkon; neyau sii enaisho oo sabibu, o lng'anayio loo sabibu, o lng'abolo, o lolan loo mpukunot pooki ooyautua ninche atua Yerusalem te nkolong e Sabato. Aikoo apa nanu ninche teina olong natimira endaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore sii iltung'ana le Turo apa ootii ina anasa, neya isinkir o ntokitin oo mpukunot pooki naamiri, nemiraki ninche te nkolong e Sabato iltung'ana le Yuda te Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naisikong nanu lelo kituaak le Yuda najoki ninche, “Kainyoo ena bae torrono niaasitata, aaisarkionie enkolong e Sabato? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ketaasa apa iloo papaai linyi ena, naa keitu eyau Enkai ang ena torroni pooki shumata iyiook o shumata ena anasa? Ore ake eyia, iyauu intae engoro kitok shumata Israel, aaisarkionie Sabato.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eiteru amisimisu too nchomito e Yerusalem eng'or Sabato, naitanapisho nanu pee eikeni nkutukie oo nkajijik nemeboli ometulusoi Sabato. Napik nanu embata oo sinkan laainei meitasheiki nchomito, pee meetae olola oitijing'uni te nkolong e sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo ainyiang'ak o lamirak loo mpukunot pooki neirrag auluo Yerusalem enkolong nabo anaa nkolong'i are. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake aikoo nanu ninche najoki ninche, “Kainyoo intae pee irragirraga tioriong e suntai? Teningiligili aaiko neijia, naibung nanu intae.” Ore ebaiki ina olong neito idia alo eitu ninche eigil aapuonu te nkolong e Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naitanap nanu Ilawi pee eitisiny ate nepuonu aarrip nchomito, neitaa enkolong e Sabato Sinyati. Tadamuaki sii ena te nkaraki nanu, na Ai ai, nikileku nanu te risioroto e nkitoo e nyorrata ino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
