          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore olpisiaai loo nkera enye neiro enkutuk e Ashdod, nemeidim ninche aairoro enkutuk e Yuda, kake keidim aairoro nkutukie e lelo tung'ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nailepilepaki nanu ninche, nadek ninche, naidong kulikae lenye nayiet ilpapit lenye, nainosie ninche olmumai te nkarna e Nkai, ajoki, “Mincho iyie ntoyie inono ilayiok lenye, nimiyaki ilayiok linono ntoyie enye, nimiyamiyama intae maate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.12.24+2SA.12.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 12.24-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.11.1+1CH.11.2+1CH.11.3+1CH.11.4+1CH.11.5+1CH.11.6+1CH.11.7+1CH.11.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Int 11.1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Keitu apa eas olaiguanani Solomon eng'oki tenkaraki kuna kituaak? Ore tiatua iloshon kumok meetae olaiguanani otiu anaa ninye, naa kirotet te Nkai enye, neitaa Enkai ninye olaiguanani te shumata Israel pooki; ore ake eyia, etorikokitio nkituaak oo loreren ninye metaasa ing'ok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eikining naa iyiook intae nikias ena torroni sapuk aagolong'aki Enkai ang, aayam nkituaak oo loreren?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
